<title>USA: Chrysler to report Q2 earnings July 11.</title>
<headline>Chrysler to report Q2 earnings July 11.</headline>
<dateline>AUBURN HILLS, Mich. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Corp on Wednesday said it planned to announce its second-quarter earnings on Friday, July 11, at 0800 EDT/1200 GMT.</p>
<p>Analysts on average expect the automaker to post earnings of $0.71 a share, according to a First Call survey. Their estimates range from $0.65 to $1.10.</p>
<p>For the second quarter of 1996, the company reported earnings of $1.38 a share on a fully diluted basis.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
